<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA'S JSE RE-ELECTS JOHNSTON AS CHAIRMAN.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA'S JSE RE-ELECTS JOHNSTON AS CHAIRMAN.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Friday that Bobby Johnston had been re-elected its chairman for the coming year.</p>
<p>Norman Lowenthal had also been re-elected deputy chairman, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
